# Temporary Chromium profiles created while capturing public screenshots.
# Keep the final PNG/GIF evidence files, but never commit browser caches,
# extension state, cookies, history, or machine-local profile metadata.
screenshots/**/profile-*/

# Raw upstream demo downloads used only while selecting the three final,
# report-linked screenshots. They are large and are not referenced by reports.
screenshots/open_source/*.gif
screenshots/open_source/*-contact.png
